    "detailed_description": "Terminal Adventure is an instance based card battler. Build decks to take on quest and progress your adventurer rank. Take your deck online and battle your friends!<br><br><u>Content</u><br><strong>Adventure mode</strong><br>Begin your adventure in the guild hall. Pick out quests from the quest board to take on other premade decks in a 1v1 PvE deck battle.<br>Acquire money and cards from the quests to build your deck.<br><br><strong>Card Shop</strong><br>Using the gold you earn from completing quests, buy cards from the shop that can be added to your deck.<br><br><strong>Deck building</strong><br>Go to the open table in the guild hall to edit your deck. Using the cards you gain from quests and the shop, create a deck you feel will bring you victory. Make multiple decks you can choose between.<br><br><strong>Karma</strong><br>Taking quests of certain alignment will grace you with positive or negative karma. Watch your guild hall transform as you delve deeper into your preferred alignment.<br><br><strong>Multiplayer</strong><br>Battle your friends online with the decks you made from adventure mode through steam's servers or LAN connection.",
    "about_the_game": "Terminal Adventure is an instance based card battler. Build decks to take on quest and progress your adventurer rank. Take your deck online and battle your friends!<br><br><u>Content</u><br><strong>Adventure mode</strong><br>Begin your adventure in the guild hall. Pick out quests from the quest board to take on other premade decks in a 1v1 PvE deck battle.<br>Acquire money and cards from the quests to build your deck.<br><br><strong>Card Shop</strong><br>Using the gold you earn from completing quests, buy cards from the shop that can be added to your deck.<br><br><strong>Deck building</strong><br>Go to the open table in the guild hall to edit your deck. Using the cards you gain from quests and the shop, create a deck you feel will bring you victory. Make multiple decks you can choose between.<br><br><strong>Karma</strong><br>Taking quests of certain alignment will grace you with positive or negative karma. Watch your guild hall transform as you delve deeper into your preferred alignment.<br><br><strong>Multiplayer</strong><br>Battle your friends online with the decks you made from adventure mode through steam's servers or LAN connection.",
    "short_description": "A fantasy deck builder. Acquire new cards through quests to build your perfect party. Choose your alignment through action. Battle your friends online. Become the strongest adventurer guild around.",
